Server init.

>> x := Blob uus: 65 tüüp: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Programm seade: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server seo: (
 Loend uus ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Loend uus ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x alates: 0 pikkus: 1), reavahetus.
x vabasta.

